          "label": "Marini MR 2 PN, 3D model",
          "size": "1.8 MB",
          "gen": true
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "html": "MR 2 PN is Marini's best seller: a pneumatic drilling unit for work on steep slopes. The wide tubular frame stands on three swivelling supports that follow uneven ground, and the supports turn 90 degrees so the rig is easy to move sideways. MR 2 PN can take a pneumatic rotary head for 2, 3 and 4 inch down-the-hole hammers or a pneumatic drifter. The feed is driven by a pneumatic piston motor.",
          "gen": true
        },
